      "message": "Does the order of checks assume a particular order for the profiles in `getOutputProfiles`? I can imagine two cases:\n\nin the first, the order is:\n  - AUDIO_OUTPUT_FLAG_DIRECT\n  - AUDIO_OUTPUT_FLAG_COMPRESS_OFFLOAD | AUDIO_OUTPUT_FLAG_DIRECT \n\nIn this case, on the first iteration:\n  - profile \u003d\u003d nullptr, then profile :\u003d curProfile; then exit the loop due to the new code (check on the line 1166); thus the direct port will be chosen.\n  \nAnother possibility is:\n  - AUDIO_OUTPUT_FLAG_COMPRESS_OFFLOAD | AUDIO_OUTPUT_FLAG_DIRECT \n  - AUDIO_OUTPUT_FLAG_DIRECT\n\nIn this case, on the first iteration:\n  - profile \u003d\u003d nullptr, then profile :\u003d curProfile; then exit the loop due to the condition on the line 1170; thus the compress offload port will be chosen.",
